cat << EOF
TexMakerX is a fork of the LaTeX IDE TexMaker, and gives you an environment where
you can easily create and manage LaTeX documents. It provides modern writing support,
like interactive spell checking, code  folding and syntax highlighting. Also, it
serves as a starting point from where you can easily run all necessary LaTeX tools.

Note: They have renamed this project to TeXstudio.
EOF
